08:05:03.877 --> 08:05:08.797
DM: And it's, but the inside of the, of the pool is just like,

08:05:09.857 --> 08:05:10.097
DM: um,

08:05:11.157 --> 08:05:16.737
DM: it's filled with like s- things that sparkle, like gems, glass,

08:05:17.777 --> 08:05:18.057
DM: um,

08:05:19.137 --> 08:05:21.957
DM: some coins, but mostly not coins.

08:05:21.957 --> 08:05:26.297
DM: Um, little silver statues of, of Kaikkea.

08:05:26.297 --> 08:05:27.817
Unknown: Um, a few actually have,

08:05:28.857 --> 08:05:31.536
DM: a few like, um, larger sort of, um,

08:05:32.697 --> 08:05:36.137
