08:05:37.557 --> 08:05:40.677
DM: of Kaikkea. It seems like this would be something people would throw,

08:05:42.717 --> 08:05:43.537
DM: um, their,

08:05:47.657 --> 08:05:49.597
DM: uh, you know, things that were...

08:06:02.857 --> 08:06:03.317
DM: Um,

08:06:04.837 --> 08:06:05.497
DM: things that were-

08:06:05.597 --> 08:06:06.677
