08:06:06.677 --> 08:06:07.037
DM: Yeah.

08:06:07.057 --> 08:06:07.477
Seeker: That's awesome.

08:06:09.237 --> 08:06:12.457
DM: It, and it, it seems like this, this is like people would throw-

08:06:13.937 --> 08:06:13.937
Unknown: Beautiful

08:06:13.937 --> 08:06:17.337
DM: ... valuable items into this, and some of the-

08:06:17.357 --> 08:06:18.337
DM: That as well

08:06:18.337 --> 08:06:22.677
