08:06:41.897 --> 08:06:42.237
Delwath: Like any-

08:06:42.257 --> 08:06:42.857
Wellby: Detect Magic.

08:06:43.337 --> 08:06:45.397
Delwath: Yeah. Well, well actually anything magical.

08:06:45.397 --> 08:06:45.477
Unknown: Like was this something cursed or?

08:06:45.477 --> 08:06:47.357
Delwath: But I will also Detect Magic.

08:06:47.357 --> 08:06:47.517
Unknown: But

08:06:48.737 --> 08:06:51.357
