08:06:52.477 --> 08:06:53.057
DM: Ah, so.

08:06:53.117 --> 08:06:53.277
Unknown: Mm.

08:06:53.497 --> 08:06:53.857
Seeker: Mm, mm, mm, mm, mm.

08:06:53.897 --> 08:06:54.817
Delwath: Use more of the helmet.

08:06:54.817 --> 08:06:56.437
Unknown: Ha ha, we saved that charge for a reason.

08:06:56.437 --> 08:06:56.837
DM: We did.

08:06:57.877 --> 08:06:59.357
Delwath: The helmet.

08:06:59.397 --> 08:06:59.957
Delwath: The what?

08:06:59.957 --> 08:07:00.417
Delwath: His helmet.

08:07:00.437 --> 08:07:01.237
Wellby: Oh, the horn helmet.

08:07:01.257 --> 08:07:02.197
DM: The helmet. The horn helmet.

08:07:02.977 --> 08:07:03.597
DM: Mm.

08:07:04.837 --> 08:07:04.957
Unknown: Yeah?

08:07:06.937 --> 08:07:08.577
Delwath: Might be a good mirror thing.

