08:07:40.385 --> 08:07:41.045
Kenzo: It may not.

08:07:41.325 --> 08:07:43.965
DM: I mean, you could always keep the helmet and wait for a couple days.

08:07:44.005 --> 08:07:44.705
Delwath: We could wait.

08:07:45.305 --> 08:07:45.925
Delwath: Yeah. We could wait.

08:07:45.985 --> 08:07:49.125
