08:07:49.424 --> 08:07:50.945
Unknown: Fuck it. I think we just see the helm.

08:07:51.005 --> 08:07:51.385
Seeker: Yeah.

08:07:51.405 --> 08:07:52.625
Wellby: That's a really good idea, yeah.

08:07:52.905 --> 08:07:53.325
