08:07:53.645 --> 08:07:53.805
Unknown: Okay.

08:07:55.785 --> 08:07:56.785
Seeker: Helmet, helmet.

08:07:56.825 --> 08:07:58.585
Unknown: Here, roll a D20, my guy.

08:07:58.605 --> 08:07:59.365
Kenzo: Huh?

08:07:59.365 --> 08:08:00.805
DM: Roll a D20.

08:08:00.805 --> 08:08:01.865
