08:10:25.565 --> 08:10:30.685
DM: Like a, like a reasonably well off Tollen or a merchant captain or something like that.

08:10:32.365 --> 08:10:35.025
DM: But he's, like, shouting and,

08:10:36.165 --> 08:10:41.025
