08:10:42.565 --> 08:10:42.945
DM: Um,

08:10:44.105 --> 08:10:46.185
DM: oh yeah, speak in Common so you can read his lips.

08:10:46.945 --> 08:10:48.345
DM: Um, he's saying, um,

08:10:49.465 --> 08:10:50.965
DM: he starts by saying, um,

08:10:52.745 --> 08:10:54.805
DM: like basically he's begging.

08:10:54.805 --> 08:10:56.945
DM: Like, "You took, you took my, my goods.

08:10:56.945 --> 08:10:59.565
DM: You, you, you took my, um,

08:11:00.385 --> 08:11:01.005
DM: you took my,

08:11:02.645 --> 08:11:05.265
DM: all my money. Spare my life at least."

08:11:05.265 --> 08:11:07.285
DM: Like, "I have a family."

08:11:07.285 --> 08:11:08.805
DM: Um, and you can't hear what, um,

08:11:09.925 --> 08:11:10.045
DM: uh,

08:11:11.065 --> 08:11:13.305
DM: what Urgall says in, in response.

08:11:13.305 --> 08:11:13.485
DM: Um,

08:11:14.965 --> 08:11:19.285
DM: but, you know, then he, the, the merchant says, "No, no."

08:11:19.285 --> 08:11:20.985
DM: And, like, his throat is slashed.

08:11:20.985 --> 08:11:21.885
Delwath: Damn.

08:11:21.885 --> 08:11:32.505
DM: And then, um, you see kind of like, um, pooling out of where the merchant was hit this like, like faint sort of

08:11:32.505 --> 08:11:33.345
DM: blackish

08:11:34.385 --> 08:11:36.925
DM: acrid mist. And, like, um,

08:11:38.904 --> 08:11:41.785
DM: Urgall sort of takes a deep breath and, like breathes.

08:11:41.785 --> 08:11:43.085
DM: Like he was expecting this.

08:11:43.085 --> 08:11:50.025
DM: This isn't, like, a surprise, but breathes it in and, and you can almost, like, feel the horns of the helmet glowing.

08:11:51.245 --> 08:11:53.005
DM: Um, and then he turns and he, um,

08:11:54.165 --> 08:11:54.365
DM: uh,

08:11:56.045 --> 08:11:59.545
DM: picks, he picks up another, like maybe the navigator or somebody,

08:12:01.485 --> 08:12:01.745
DM: and

08:12:03.085 --> 08:12:05.945
DM: he says again something to him.

08:12:05.945 --> 08:12:12.385
DM: And the navigator says, "I, I- I'll, I'll show you.

08:12:12.385 --> 08:12:15.485
DM: I, I'll show you. I, I promise.

08:12:15.485 --> 08:12:15.685
DM: Um,

08:12:16.805 --> 08:12:18.645
DM: please spare my life."

08:12:22.045 --> 08:12:26.965
DM: And you see him sort of sketch, like, a, like, a, a map

08:12:28.445 --> 08:12:29.165
DM: and draw

08:12:30.305 --> 08:12:33.545
DM: a line pointing towards this island

08:12:34.965 --> 08:12:38.305
DM: as his throat is cut and blood spatters all over the map.

08:12:40.525 --> 08:12:41.725
DM: And then the scene shifts,

08:12:42.985 --> 08:12:43.185
DM: um,

08:12:44.365 --> 08:12:45.065
DM: and he is,

08:12:46.105 --> 08:12:53.585
DM: Urgall is, is, uh, standing at the side of the ship or, like, sort of mid ships, right?

08:12:53.585 --> 08:12:56.425
DM: Um, and he seems to be

08:12:59.865 --> 08:13:01.125
DM: not exactly praying,

08:13:02.285 --> 08:13:09.425
DM: but he's caught in some sort of ritual, some sort of, um,

08:13:11.565 --> 08:13:13.925
DM: twisted act of devotion.

08:13:15.265 --> 08:13:20.233
DM: Um, and you can see as this happens, like, there's these sort of black...

08:13:20.233 --> 08:13:26.293
DM: ... veins that are growing up his hands, and he reaches the matter and he grasps, and you can see the waves just

08:13:27.393 --> 08:13:28.913
Unknown: stop in front of him.

08:13:29.513 --> 08:13:31.993
DM: He just clears the water.

08:13:31.993 --> 08:13:42.073
DM: And as this happens, you can see these sort of like greenish streaks that appear in the water as he's clearing it, and this like black,

08:13:42.093 --> 08:13:49.633
DM: like almost like, it's like acid kind of dripping through his fingers, and it's clearly like burning his arms as he's doing this.

08:13:49.633 --> 08:13:56.133
DM: But as he does this, the w- the water shifts, the current shifts, and his ship turns into the wind and begins moving.

08:13:57.533 --> 08:13:59.873
Delwath: Do the greenish streaks look like the poison?

08:13:59.913 --> 08:14:01.273
DM: It's like he's casting a spell.

08:14:01.393 --> 08:14:05.113
Delwath: No, but I mean, does it look like the poison in the water from the demon?

08:14:06.533 --> 08:14:09.353
DM: No, it just looks like, it just looks like, like he's obviously-

08:14:09.393 --> 08:14:09.513
Unknown: Right

08:14:09.513 --> 08:14:11.313
DM: ... magically controlling the water, right?

08:14:11.313 --> 08:14:15.713
DM: It's not like there's a something in the water, it's just like the visual effect of casting a spell.

08:14:18.393 --> 08:14:18.533
Unknown: Right.

08:14:18.553 --> 08:14:25.352
DM: Um, but the like, you know, the acid burning on his hands looks basically exactly like what Seeker was covered in.

08:14:27.633 --> 08:14:28.493
Seeker: Mm-hmm.

08:14:28.513 --> 08:14:28.553
Unknown: Hmm.

08:14:28.553 --> 08:14:29.733
Seeker: It wasn't nice.

08:14:29.733 --> 08:14:31.013
DM: And then the ship turns

08:14:32.133 --> 08:14:33.693
DM: and sails straight in the wind

08:14:34.833 --> 08:14:39.593
DM: towards, you can see now from his point of view, the island ahead of you.

08:14:40.413 --> 08:14:40.913
Kenzo: Through the mist?

08:14:41.593 --> 08:14:42.233
DM: No mist.

08:14:42.813 --> 08:14:43.213
DM: Hmm.

08:14:43.213 --> 08:14:45.473
DM: This is in the mirror, this is before the mist appeared.

08:14:45.493 --> 08:14:46.293
Seeker: Mm-hmm.

08:14:46.293 --> 08:14:48.053
Seeker: It was triggered by their arrival.

08:14:48.673 --> 08:14:49.093
DM: Yeah.

08:14:49.113 --> 08:14:49.813
DM: Mm-hmm.

08:14:49.913 --> 08:14:50.113
DM: Um,

08:14:52.233 --> 08:14:52.833
DM: and then

08:14:54.393 --> 08:14:58.993
DM: a flash again and you see the scene that was described to you by Tovaak, the

08:15:00.153 --> 08:15:03.893
DM: nighttime fire, um, leaving the ship.

08:15:06.953 --> 08:15:09.933
DM: And then one last vision.

08:15:11.133 --> 08:15:12.693
DM: You see, um,

08:15:15.573 --> 08:15:26.053
DM: Urgall again, now this time holding up like 10 of his crew, um, in a row, slitting each one's throat,

08:15:26.053 --> 08:15:36.273
DM: and as each one's throat is in turn, slit in turn, like more of his skin sort of corrodes away, and he like takes these deep breaths as he s-

08:15:36.273 --> 08:15:37.593
DM: cuts each one's throat.

08:15:37.593 --> 08:15:47.813
DM: And as this happens, you can see, like this is happening in this cloister, and you can see through the, through the door, um, to

08:15:47.813 --> 08:15:53.813
DM: the sacred waters, and as he cuts each one, this acid sort of, you can see the waters begin to boil.

08:15:56.693 --> 08:15:57.493
DM: And boil.

08:15:59.293 --> 08:16:02.033
DM: Slits another one's throat, and suddenly a tentacle

08:16:03.053 --> 08:16:06.773
DM: reaches up through the waters, and Urgall screams.

08:16:08.133 --> 08:16:08.553
DM: And like,

08:16:09.693 --> 08:16:19.733
DM: uh, blood starts running down from his fingers, and his flesh begins to melt off of his hands as he turns into this sort of gaunt, undead-like creature you fought, and this

08:16:19.753 --> 08:16:23.113
DM: tentacled demon crawls its way out through the water.

08:16:25.253 --> 08:16:29.933
Kenzo: Watching this, is this sort of like a ritual sacrifice, leads to some portal opening?

08:16:30.013 --> 08:16:30.973
DM: Yeah, definitely.

08:16:31.993 --> 08:16:31.993
DM: Uh-

08:16:32.013 --> 08:16:33.713
Seeker: Does it seem to revolve around the

08:16:35.353 --> 08:16:35.813
Seeker: Horned Helm itself?

08:16:35.813 --> 08:16:36.333
DM: I mean, the,

08:16:38.033 --> 08:16:40.233
DM: uh, that's just the perspective you're seeing it from.

08:16:40.233 --> 08:16:44.453
DM: The, the implication is like he made a deal for power.

08:16:44.673 --> 08:16:45.693
Seeker: Mm-hmm.

08:16:45.713 --> 08:16:47.653
DM: And then had to uphold his end of the bargain.

08:16:48.193 --> 08:16:50.813
DM: Like, he got magic to control the ocean.

08:16:52.413 --> 08:16:55.193
Delwath: But the helm wasn't necessarily the source of it.

08:16:55.233 --> 08:16:56.873
Unknown: No. The helm was not the source.

08:16:56.873 --> 08:16:58.453
Kenzo: But did we, did we see anything about the deal he made?

